Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.78,0:00:03.14,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.14,0:00:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,交易都在十字路口做 咒语很厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crossroads are where packs are made, serious spell work.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.55,0:00:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就跟恶魔有关了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I means it got something to do with demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.51,0:00:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人竟然跟恶魔做交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}These people are actually making deals with the damned thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.81,0:00:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们看到的是地狱之犬 恶魔的斗牛犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're seeing hellhounds … demonic pit bulls.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.29,0:00:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能控制他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can control them?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.30,0:00:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,去咬他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sic him, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.54,0:00:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖思终于把他们带到了他的船屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Garth finally got them to his houseboat,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.05,0:00:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但凯文读他们手里那半块石碑并不顺利\N{\fnArial\fs30}but Kevin's having a lot of trouble reading their half of the tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.25,0:00:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 门口那是什么东西 - 巫尘\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, what is that stuff out front? - Goofer dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.34,0:00:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个自以为了不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}You boys think you know something about something,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.23,0:00:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,却连巫尘都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}but not goofer dust?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是什么东西 - 巫术\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is it? - Hoodoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.04,0:00:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,阻挡恶魔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keeps out demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.76,0:00:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,盒子里有一把钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the box is the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.86,0:00:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,能找到一切 卷轴 咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}to every object, scroll, spell,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.76,0:00:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,几千年来收集的所有东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}ever collected for thousands of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.90,0:00:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,都放在一个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}under one roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.01,0:00:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直是超自然知识的金矿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is the supernatural mother lode.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.49,0:00:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果知识是力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}If knowledge is power,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.42,0:00:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那这就是世界上最有威力的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}then this is the most powerful place on earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.33,0:00:45.74,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.26,0:01:19.32,Note,0,0,0,0,,（阿司匹林）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.68,0:02:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.27,0:02:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.09,0:02:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.57,0:02:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第8季第14集]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.36,0:02:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.13,0:03:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不赖啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.13,0:03:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不赖\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Not bad"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.11,0:03:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来没有过自己的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't had my own room…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.02,0:03:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.62,0:03:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这简直棒呆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm making this awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.37,0:03:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有超棒的唱片\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got my kickass vinyl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.00,0:03:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有妙不可言的床垫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got this killer mattress.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.08,0:03:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,记忆棉的 它还能记住我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Memory foam … it remembers me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.16,0:03:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是干净的 没有怪味\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's clean, too. There's no funky smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.86,0:03:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不像汽车旅馆有些吓人的污渍\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no creepy motel stains.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.16,0:03:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.34,0:03:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.51,0:03:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去弄点吃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go fix us some grub.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.84,0:04:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,看什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you reading?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.94,0:04:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都读\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sort of, uh, everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.52,0:04:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.87,0:04:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,总得有人把这些都读一读\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody's gonna have to dig through all this,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.14,0:04:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那人肯定不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it ain't gonna be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.09,0:04:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made these?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.82,0:04:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在有厨房了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a real kitchen now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.88,0:04:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我只是以为你不知道厨房为何物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I-I just didn't think you knew what a kitchen was.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.78,0:04:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要在这儿安顿下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm nesting, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.29,0:04:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃你的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.73,0:04:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.22,0:04:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.85,0:04:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.04,0:04:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean? Come quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.78,0:05:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.58,0:05:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.45,0:05:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.85,0:05:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,出事了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.59,0:05:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你猜呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.28,0:05:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文 是我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin? It's us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.96,0:05:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.74,0:05:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你气色真是糟透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. You look like hammered crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.68,0:05:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.63,0:05:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还睡觉吗 - 不怎么睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you sleeping? - Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.98,0:05:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吃东西了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you eating?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.27,0:05:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,基本上是吃热狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hot dogs, mostly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.17,0:05:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 最佳早餐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, yeah … breakfast of champions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.87,0:06:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这么说都觉得不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm gonna feel dirty saying this,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.17,0:06:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你该吃点沙拉再洗个澡\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you might want a salad and a shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.92,0:06:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我一直头疼又流鼻血\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, and I've been getting bad headaches and nosebleeds,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.00,0:06:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好像还小小地中风了一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I think maybe I had a small stroke.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.10,0:06:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这都是值得的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it was worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.88,0:06:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,值得什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was worth it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.62,0:06:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道怎么关闭地狱之门了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured out how to close the gates of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.21,0:06:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You …
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.50,0:06:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来抱抱 你个臭小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here, you smelly son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.56,0:06:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那这是什么个情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay. So, what does this mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.50,0:06:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 到底是什么东西 - 是个咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are we looking at? - It's a spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.88,0:06:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.89,0:06:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是几句天使语\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's just a few words of enochian, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.94,0:06:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.66,0:06:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次说出咒语之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}The spell has to be spoken…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.15,0:06:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,都得先通过测试 共有三道咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}after you finish each of the three trials.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.69,0:06:44.69,Title,0,0,0,0,,庭审 《法律与秩序》那种吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}T-trials like, uh, like "Law & order"?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.83,0:06:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,过五关斩六将那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}More like Hercules.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.91,0:06:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,石碑上说 「决定担此重任之人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tablet says, "Whosoever chooses to undertake these tasks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.14,0:06:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须不惧危险 死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}should fear not danger, nor death, nor…"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.19,0:06:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一个词貌似是把你的脊椎\N{\fnArial\fs30}A word I think means getting your spine ripped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.62,0:07:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,从你嘴里扯出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}through your mouth for all eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.14,0:07:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good times.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.28,0:07:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,总体来说 上帝建立了一系列测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Basically, God built a series of tests,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.78,0:07:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你都完成了 就可以去关门了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and when you've done all three, you can slam the gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.28,0:07:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 上帝想让我们参加高考吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, God wants us to take the SATs?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.93,0:07:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多吧 上帝的意旨深不可测\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I guess. Uh, he works in mysterious ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.59,0:07:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 深不可测的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, mysterious, douche-y ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.03,0:07:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 第一项是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Where do we start?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.90,0:07:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前我只破解出一项测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've only been able to crack one of the tests so far,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.51,0:07:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且挺恶心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.22,0:07:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得杀一只地狱之犬并浸于它的血中\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to kill a hound of hell and bathe in its blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.44,0:07:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,棒极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.50,0:07:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这有什么棒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.58,0:07:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.96,0:07:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果能干掉所有的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, if this means icing all demons,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.91,0:07:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完全不介意杀条恶魔狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got no problem gutting some devil dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.24,0:07:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,再淋上他的鲜血\N{\fnArial\fs30}and letting Calgon take me away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.17,0:07:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们上哪去找啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you gonna find one?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.64,0:07:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱之犬总去收恶魔交易的账\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, hellhounds like to collect on crossroads deals.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.57,0:07:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只要找到一个十年前\N{\fnArial\fs30}So all we got to do is track down some loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.29,0:07:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了某件事而做了交易的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}who signed over his special sauce 10 years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.59,0:07:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后拦下一只冲着他去的地狱之犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}get between him and Clifford the big dead dog …
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.94,0:07:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.03,0:07:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来并不轻松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't sound easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.26,0:07:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确不轻松\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.33,0:07:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去网上查查看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you get on the net … see what you can dig up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.70,0:07:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去买东西 我们需要巫尘\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go for a supply run because we need goofer dust,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.16,0:07:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且这孩子需要吃点\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the kid needs to eat something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.19,0:07:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,长蹄子的动物和猪菊花以外的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's not ground-up hooves and pigs' anuses …
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.77,0:08:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒不是说那样有什么不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}not that there's anything wrong with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.76,0:08:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I feel a lot better.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.72,0:08:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文 伙计 你得悠着点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Kevin, buddy, you got to slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.92,0:08:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.79,0:08:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,去睡一觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get some shut-eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.15,0:08:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,休息一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a day off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.94,0:08:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,开开窗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open a window.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.97,0:08:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.79,0:08:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说要干掉地狱 那样我才能出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said nuking hell … that's how I get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.16,0:08:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样我才能回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how I go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.21,0:08:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 但你不能这么生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, it is, but you can't live like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.14,0:08:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我愿意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I want to?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.15,0:08:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也讨厌这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.74,0:08:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是这世上的每个恶魔都想杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't leave because every demon on the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.48,0:08:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我不能离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}wants to peel my face off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.93,0:08:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了你们 偶尔过来的盖思还有我妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't talk to anyone except you guys or Garth,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.11,0:08:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能接触别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}when he swings by, or my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.31,0:08:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,她打电话来也只是哭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right? And when she calls, all she does is cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.93,0:08:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.26,0:08:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想结束这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need this to be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.89,0:08:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.11,0:08:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你得听我一句\N{\fnArial\fs30}But trust me on this …
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.57,0:08:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,拯救世界这档子事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whole "saving the world" thing …
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.45,0:08:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个马拉松 不是短跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's a marathon, not a sprint.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.48,0:09:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得好好照顾自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to take better care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.81,0:09:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道西红柿有六千种吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you know that there are, like, 6, 000 kinds of tomatoes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.01,0:09:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,查到什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you find anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.90,0:09:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 十年前恶魔的形迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, demon signs, 10 years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.54,0:09:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,中心点在爱达荷州 肖松尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}all centered on Shoshone, Idaho.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.69,0:09:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,动静越大 恶魔来头越大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, big-time mojo means a big-time freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.79,0:09:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那儿有谁撞大运了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, anybody have a horseshoe shoved up his ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.84,0:09:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's one way of putting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.20,0:09:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是卡西迪一家 本是小农民\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meet the Cassitys, small-time farmers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.35,0:09:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,03年2月却在自家地里挖到了油\N{\fnArial\fs30}who struck oil on their land in February of '03,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.00,0:09:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇怪的是 地理勘探显示…\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is weird because geological surveys …
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.22,0:09:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说「奇怪」就够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you had me at "weird."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.78,0:09:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 这是交易吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. We thinking deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.28,0:09:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是最佳线索了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best lead we've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.75,0:09:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,去见见这些新土豪吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's go visit the Beverly Hillbillies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.81,0:09:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你留下继续研究第二项测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay here, work on step number 2,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.45,0:09:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果看到什么跟地狱之犬有关的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, uh, if you come across anything about hellhounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.02,0:09:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我们说一声\N{\fnArial\fs30}drop a dime, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.87,0:09:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为那些东西又是利爪 尖牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause between the … the claws and the teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.61,0:09:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是隐形什么的 所以他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the whole invisibility thing, those bitches can be…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.97,0:09:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺不好对付的\N{\fnArial\fs30}real bitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.34,0:09:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你买了礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you a present.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.75,0:10:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓝色的是治头疼的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The, uh, blue ones are for the headaches,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.02,0:10:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿色的让你有精神\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the greens are for pep.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.57,0:10:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,别服过量了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't O.D.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.46,0:10:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.40,0:10:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.53,0:10:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 现在离成功只有一步了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, we are on the one-yard-line.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.92,0:10:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得死撑下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is time to play through the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.67,0:10:27.56,Note,0,0,0,0,,（卡西迪牧场）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.68,0:10:32.39,Note,0,0,0,0,,（爱达荷州 肖松尼）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.26,0:10:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 留心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, keep an eye out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.12,0:10:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,被地狱之犬盯上的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody with a hellhound on their ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.49,0:10:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定会表露出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}is gonna be showing signs …
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.37,0:10:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到幻象 惊恐不已什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}hallucinating, freaking out … the usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.48,0:10:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果找到了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if we find someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.01,0:10:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把他们引开\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get 'em clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.28,0:10:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去干掉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I spike fido.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.73,0:10:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,皆大欢喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}The crowd goes wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.94,0:10:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 这里谁管事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, pal, who runs this joint?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.60,0:11:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're looking at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.24,0:11:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是农场主\N{\fnArial\fs30}You…own the ranch?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.41,0:11:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 只是打理而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope, just manage the property.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.79,0:11:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是来找活儿干的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys here about the job?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.29,0:11:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么猜到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.92,0:11:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这儿来过不少到处漂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get our share of drifters.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.53,0:11:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在农场干过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever worked a farm before?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.55,0:11:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.47,0:11:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们学得很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're quick learners.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.14,0:11:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉 这是谁啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellie…who we got here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.99,0:11:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是迪恩 这是萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Dean. This is Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.39,0:11:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔·格兰维尔 幸会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl Granville. A pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.87,0:11:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸会 你不是卡西迪家的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pleasure. So you're not a Cassity?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.73,0:11:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 内人是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, my wife is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.96,0:11:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他们家的财产\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her and her family own the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.58,0:11:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是个 怎么说来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just one those, uh … what you call 'em? …
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.20,0:11:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,奖杯丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}trophy husbands.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.10,0:11:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要雇他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we, uh, hiring the fellas?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.22,0:11:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没想好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not sure yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.55,0:11:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,雇吧 他们看起来挺不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on. They seem like swell guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.94,0:11:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我们挺不错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's right. We're swell.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.24,0:12:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的床在这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bed down in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.01,0:12:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,五点早饭 八点晚饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breakfast is at 5:00, dinner is at 8:00,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.08,0:12:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那之间 都听我使唤\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in between, you're mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.87,0:12:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.80,0:12:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怀念我的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.25,0:12:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.37,0:12:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 如果你们愿意就可以雇你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Job is yours if you want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.03,0:12:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但得提醒你们一句 活儿挺累的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I better warn you … it's crap work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.69,0:12:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,屎 原来真是屎的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crap … she literally meant crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.43,0:12:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恨你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.04,0:12:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不管 你觉得我像个嬉皮士吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care. Do I look like a hippie?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.16,0:12:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,有机食物对牛更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Organic food is better for the cattle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.85,0:12:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的地 我的牲畜 我的钱 我说了算\N{\fnArial\fs30}My land, my animals, my money, my way … end of story.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.20,0:12:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还挺厉害啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a real piece of work, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.00,0:12:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱丽丝·卡西迪是挺「厉害」的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice Cassity's a piece of something, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.10,0:12:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是也没办法 她是老板\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what are we gonna do? She's the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.67,0:12:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝一杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.63,0:13:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么看\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what are we thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.94,0:13:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说交易的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, dealwise?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.51,0:13:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉只是雇员 她肯定排除\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Ellie's the help, so that rules her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.49,0:13:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔看上去不像出卖灵魂的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Carl doesn't really seem like the sell-your-soul type.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.06,0:13:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是爱丽丝吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Alice?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.25,0:13:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,猜中了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ding-ding-ding.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.54,0:13:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,去跟她谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should we talk to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.82,0:13:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好让对我们撒谎 再去报警吗 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? So she can lie to us and then call the cops? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.13,0:13:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这次我们跟住她就行 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we're gonna have to go stalker on this one, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.49,0:13:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 整匹马吗 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The whole horse? - Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.86,0:13:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是吧 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Seriously? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.77,0:13:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,她怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does she …
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.10,0:13:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是只狼吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a wolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.45,0:13:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.46,0:13:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概把马都吓坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably spooked the hell out of the horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.52,0:13:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去看看他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should check on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.06,0:13:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 快点回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, all right. Hurry back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.81,0:13:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.74,0:14:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.71,0:14:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}God almighty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.96,0:14:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很遗憾艾莉 卡尔看上去人不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Ellie. Carl seemed like a good guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.81,0:14:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他最好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The best.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.57,0:14:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的头被扯下来了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say his head was practically ripped off?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.15,0:14:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.96,0:14:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好奇而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.23,0:14:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是新来的工人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's new. He works here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.01,0:14:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔死状很惨 其他的别多说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl died bad … let's leave it at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.53,0:14:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里又引入了几匹狼\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've been reintroducing wolves 'round these parts,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.49,0:14:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但是我没想到 - 这不是狼干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- but I never thought… - This wasn't a wolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.72,0:14:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得去打电话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to make some phone calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.89,0:14:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一家人都会乘飞机赶来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole family's flying in for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.71,0:15:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西迪一家团聚\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the Cassitys under one roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.42,0:15:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.78,0:15:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.55,0:15:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么看\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.64,0:15:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看卡尔做了交易 所以被狗吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think Carl signed the deal, and now he's dog food.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.14,0:15:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今狗没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hellhound's gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.32,0:15:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们当时跟错了人 没能阻止他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we were too busy chasing a pile of jack to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.69,0:15:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们拿上东西走人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's grab our stuff and get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.10,0:15:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西迪太太 你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay, Mrs. Cassity?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.78,0:15:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.13,0:15:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.80,0:15:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really am.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.95,0:15:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我应该很难过 因为我爱卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}And…I know I shouldn't be because I loved Carl…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.09,0:15:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.77,0:15:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是记不住为什么会爱上他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just can't remember why.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.61,0:16:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.70,0:16:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔是在这儿长大的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean… Carl grew up around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.99,0:16:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是同学 他一直倾心于我\N{\fnArial\fs30}We went to school together, and he was always mooning over me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.34,0:16:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我从没…我以前还取笑过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I never … I used to make fun of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.44,0:16:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们什么时候在一起的\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did you two get together?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.61,0:16:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,03年的情人节\N{\fnArial\fs30}Valentine's day, 2003.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.59,0:16:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去了一个派对\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was at this party.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.38,0:16:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔也去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl was there,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.33,0:16:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉就像我第一次看到了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it was like I was seeing him for the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.33,0:16:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他突然变得帅气 聪明 风趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, suddenly he was cute and smart and funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.27,0:16:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉很奇妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.94,0:16:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔和我幸福地生活了十年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl and I were happy for 10 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.82,0:16:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他死了 我既不悲伤也不生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now he's dead, and I'm not sad or angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.88,0:16:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么事都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just…fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.48,0:16:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有墓地的土吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, we, uh, we have any graveyard dirt?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.44,0:16:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该有吧 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.49,0:16:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓍草\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yarrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.32,0:16:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,有 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.04,0:16:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.06,0:17:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能召唤十字路口恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not summoning a crossroads demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.04,0:17:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一计划没成功 只能用备用计划了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plan "A" bombed, so welcome to plan "B" …
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.69,0:17:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们抓个红眼恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get some red-eyed bitch in a trap,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.65,0:17:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们拿刀抵着她\N{\fnArial\fs30}then we hold a knife on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.45,0:17:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到她召唤条狗来\N{\fnArial\fs30}until she calls us in a pooch …
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.80,0:17:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像快递\N{\fnArial\fs30}special delivery.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.70,0:17:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果克劳力知道我们自己找上门了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, except when Crowley finds out we're dialing up hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.51,0:17:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就不会派一只地狱之犬了 而是一百只\N{\fnArial\fs30}he won't send one hellhound … he'll send a hundred.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.70,0:17:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不叫计划 迪恩 这叫自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not a plan, Dean … that's suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.45,0:17:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有更好的主意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you got a better idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.49,0:17:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,有 我们留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.59,0:17:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚在谷仓里跟爱丽丝谈话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just talked to Alice in the barn.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.68,0:17:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔出卖灵魂不是为了石油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl didn't sell his soul for oil …
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.06,0:17:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是为了爱丽丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}he sold it for Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.52,0:17:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他老婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}His wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.56,0:17:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他爱她 而她却没注意过她\N{\fnArial\fs30}He loved her, she barely noticed him,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.09,0:17:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他就做了交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}so he made a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.68,0:17:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今时间一到\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now that time's up,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.75,0:17:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,她觉得自己甚至不认识他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's like she barely even knew the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.86,0:17:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得这个恶魔在镇上的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think our demon signed up more than one schmuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.71,0:17:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不止做了一笔交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}while he was in town?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.64,0:17:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不是第一次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't be the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.43,0:17:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 这家人能富起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Dean, this family's rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.53,0:17:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为有人订了张直达地狱的票\N{\fnArial\fs30}because someone booked a one-way ticket downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.84,0:17:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,而明天 他们都会到这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And as of tomorrow, they're all gonna be right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.46,0:17:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想把他们审一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you want to scope 'em out?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.40,0:17:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想杀条地狱之犬 还不用送命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to kill a hellhound and not die.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.41,0:17:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How 'bout you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.29,0:17:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,两天 然后按我的方法来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two days … then we do it my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.48,0:18:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是诺亚·卡西迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meet Noah Cassity.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.71,0:18:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,71岁 十亿身价\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's 71, worth a billion,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.01,0:18:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚娶了第五任妻子 20岁的内衣模特\N{\fnArial\fs30}And just married wife number 5, a 20-year-old lingerie model.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.07,0:18:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为共同语言吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause they have so much in common?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.64,0:18:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱丽丝是长女 那是辛迪 二女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice is his oldest, and that's Cindy, the middle girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.22,0:18:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,几年前她的一张专辑上过乡村音乐榜\N{\fnArial\fs30}She had a single on the country chart a few years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.56,0:18:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后她开始酗酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then she started hitting the bottle,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.25,0:18:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, well…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.96,0:18:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,她最后一张专辑是以狗为主题的节日歌曲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her last album was a bunch of holiday songs for dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.93,0:18:42.62,Title,0,0,0,0,,我最喜欢的是《铃儿吠叮当》\N{\fnArial\fs30}My favorites were "Jingle bark rock"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.67,0:18:44.48,Title,0,0,0,0,,和《别在这棵树上撒尿：植树节快乐》\N{\fnArial\fs30}and "Don't pee on this tree: happy arbor day."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.48,0:18:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是恶魔喽\N{\fnArial\fs30}So she's the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.14,0:18:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.42,0:18:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个是小女儿 玛格特\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's the baby … Margot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.58,0:18:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在爱丽丝和卡尔结婚之前离家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She ran away just before Alice and Carl tied the knot,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.87,0:18:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,住在巴黎\N{\fnArial\fs30}lives in Paris.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.20,0:18:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.45,0:18:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从13岁就开始在这儿工作了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been working on this farm since I was 13,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.34,0:19:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我长眼睛了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I've got eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.01,0:19:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚需要全员出动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, tonight is an all-hands-on-deck situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.56,0:19:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有一个人得在屋里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna need one of you inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.41,0:19:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,端盘子 倒酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}serving dinner and pouring drinks …
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.24,0:19:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒很多酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}a lot of drinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.94,0:19:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好好玩吧 我就不等你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Well, have fun. I won't wait up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.51,0:19:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,还得有人去烤肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And somebody's gonna man the grill.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.17,0:19:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么样的烤肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of grill?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.16,0:19:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不赖吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impressed?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.33,0:19:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢能烤肉的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do like a man who can handle his meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.58,0:19:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.75,0:19:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续倒吧 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it coming, Ken Doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.42,0:19:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好了 艾莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the best, Ellie.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.84,0:19:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱尔 卡尔的事我真难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Al, I'm so sorry about Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.03,0:19:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可是你的挚爱啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he was the love of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.75,0:19:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.50,0:20:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了 她能找更好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, she can do better.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.02,0:20:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许爱丽丝该找个小孩结婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Alice should marry a child …
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.91,0:20:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,像她父亲那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}take after her father.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.07,0:20:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伊凡卡不是孩子 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ivanka's not a child. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.14,0:20:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是个娃娃脸的妓女\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a prostitute who looks like a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.22,0:20:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们说完了没 爱丽丝还在服丧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you done? Alice is in mourning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.26,0:20:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm sorry, Margie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.26,0:20:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没看到你 你谁都瞧不起 都飘上天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't see you there … you're too far up on your high horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.63,0:20:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes, but you are right …
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.07,0:20:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该停一下 为卡尔说几句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should all take a minute and say a few words about Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.16,0:20:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You first.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.85,0:20:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他床上功夫好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was he a good lay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.10,0:20:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.94,0:20:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you didn't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.33,0:20:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸曾看到他们在谷仓里搞起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, daddy caught 'em going at it in the barn.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.14,0:20:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱尔 那是你们俩在一起之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Al, it was before you two got together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.87,0:20:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔他爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, Carl … he loved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.10,0:20:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 那是玛姬还是个胖妞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that was back when Margie was fat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.40,0:20:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛还没酗酒的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Cin was sober,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.42,0:20:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久之前了\N{\fnArial\fs30}a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.87,0:20:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,得癌症死掉吧 老头子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get cancer and die, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.61,0:20:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先请 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You first, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.27,0:20:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一直是这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are they always like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.80,0:20:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}More or less.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.78,0:20:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么在这儿干得下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you work here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.39,0:20:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢这块地 我喜欢动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love the property, I love the animals,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.71,0:20:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不去理会那些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I tune out the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.90,0:21:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都记不住上次我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I can't remember the last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.49,0:21:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐在一起吃饭是什么时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we all sat down and had a meal together.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.40,0:21:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是在那个破旧的老房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was back at the old, crappy house,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.14,0:21:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸请那个旅行推销员来家吃饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}when daddy invited that traveling salesman to dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.82,0:21:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.02,0:21:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他那么有魅力\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was so charming.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.80,0:21:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是英国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, English.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.04,0:21:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫什么来着 肯尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was his name … Kenny?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.48,0:21:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crow… crow…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.85,0:21:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowl… crowl…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.24,0:21:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 克劳力 - 克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Crowley? - Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.48,0:21:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 克劳力 - 他们是这么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Crowley? - That's what they said.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.11,0:21:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然他十年前曾经来过这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, he swung through town 10 years ago, to the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.37,0:21:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得是他订下了这些交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what … do you think tea and crumpets made these deals.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.01,0:21:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在来收账了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now he's collecting?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.97,0:21:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者只是派狗来 让他们去收\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or he just sent his dog … told it to go fetch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.14,0:21:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙可是地狱之王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude's king of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.00,0:21:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己出马不是太屈尊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grabbing a few souls … that's got to be below his pay grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.86,0:21:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吧 知道是谁做的交易了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess. Any idea who signed the dotted line?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.72,0:21:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.93,0:21:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们互不相让\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's brutal in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.33,0:21:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文 什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Kev, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.45,0:21:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 好消息 算是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dean, good news, uh, I think…kind of.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.20,0:21:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,别吹过头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't oversell it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.65,0:21:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.22,0:21:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在石碑上找到点东西 关于地狱之犬的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, I found something on the tablet, uh, about hellhounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.39,0:21:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道有没有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, this mean anything to you …
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.11,0:21:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有受诅咒之人 或透过圣火烤过的物体\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The dire creatures may be seen only by the damned.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.09,0:22:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能看到这些可怕的生灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}or through an object scorched with holy fire"?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.40,0:22:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说圣油吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like with holy oil?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.11,0:22:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.15,0:22:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以用窗户\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could use a window.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.45,0:22:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是眼镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.64,0:22:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们后备箱好像还有点圣油\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we've still got some jesus juice left in the trunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.38,0:22:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去弄那个X光设备\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I'll take care of the, uh, the x-ray specs.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.39,0:22:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.04,0:22:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,死死盯住这些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not let J.R. and the gang out of your sight, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.99,0:22:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 凯文 你干的漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Hey, Kevin, uh, you did great, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.51,0:22:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,去睡觉吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.90,0:22:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Tha…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.23,0:22:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧 爸爸喝醉了 还带着武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, look. Daddy's drunk and armed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.89,0:22:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定到圣诞节了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.03,0:23:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.88,0:23:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我乐意去哪去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wherever I damn well please.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.19,0:23:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只狼杀了我女婿\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wolf that killed my son-in-law …
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.46,0:23:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃人的畜生应该宰了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a man-eater, got to be put down.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.91,0:23:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是为了卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doing this for Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.21,0:23:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们先等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, just … just hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.68,0:23:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这就去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.50,0:23:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你们一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll come with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.19,0:23:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会打猎吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know anything about hunting, boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.31,0:23:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,略知一二\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little bit, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.13,0:23:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.12,0:24:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like it…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.74,0:24:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很像克拉克·肯特（超人）\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the whole Clark Kent look.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.91,0:24:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellie, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.18,0:24:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.36,0:24:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你很帅\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you're really hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.91,0:24:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,想去我房间 滚床单吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to go to my room and have sex?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.10,0:24:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.67,0:24:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I … sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.59,0:24:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一般不这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't usually do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.21,0:24:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我大概是太兴奋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I'm feeling my oats.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.37,0:24:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.70,0:24:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.08,0:24:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.01,0:24:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现眼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.69,0:24:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 我想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no, no. No, I want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.50,0:24:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,超级想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.41,0:24:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 不用照顾我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's okay … you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.45,0:24:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I'm gonna…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.57,0:24:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellie, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.47,0:25:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,改天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rain check?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.46,0:25:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,过期不候\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is one night only.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.42,0:25:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.00,0:26:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch yourself, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.41,0:26:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Margie?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.51,0:26:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为她跟你在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought she was with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.15,0:26:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天哪 - 回屋里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my god! - Go back to the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.54,0:26:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快去 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go! Move! - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.24,0:26:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么玩意儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.38,0:26:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是地狱之犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a hellhound.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.25,0:26:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,把灵魂出卖给恶魔后\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, when you sell your soul to a demon,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.56,0:26:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们就会来把你的灵魂扯出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're the ones that come and rip it out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.17,0:26:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.95,0:26:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.96,0:26:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,很风骚的男人 大概这么高 超级大混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poncey guy, about yea big, mountain of dicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.05,0:26:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道他十年前来过 帮人圆梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know he was here 10 years ago, making dreams come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.25,0:26:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们没做交易 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if you didn't sign, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.32,0:26:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面那怪物就不会碰你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That freak out there won't touch you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.93,0:26:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们做了交易 现在就告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you did, I need to know, and I need to know now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.96,0:26:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,举手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.76,0:27:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.09,0:27:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个英国佬是恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}T-the British guy was a demon,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.82,0:27:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在地狱之犬要来追杀我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now there's a hellhound after us?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.67,0:27:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-are you insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.84,0:27:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们显然是疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're obviously insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.55,0:27:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,别装傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't play dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.54,0:27:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才没有 我没出卖灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I'm not playing. I didn't sell my damn soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.14,0:27:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人这么做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, somebody did,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.10,0:27:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个白痴早点承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the sooner that idiot owns up,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.27,0:27:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人就能早点离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}the sooner the rest of you can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.53,0:27:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了 把他们锁起来 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right, seal 'em in. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.24,0:27:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 我要把巫尘\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What?! - Look, I'm gonna spread goofer dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.07,0:27:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,撒在门窗边\N{\fnArial\fs30}around the doors, the windows.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.67,0:27:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,能暂时把地狱之犬挡在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}That will keep the hellhound out…for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.94,0:27:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么 能挡多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that… how long?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.97,0:27:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我有机会一刀划开它的喉咙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long enough for me to stab it in its throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.69,0:27:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 你不能这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way. No way. You can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.88,0:27:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不能 - 我能 想知道为什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can't… - Yes, I can. You want to know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.38,0:27:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我就是干这行的 而且我是最棒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it's what I do. And, buddy, I'm the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.96,0:27:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去杀了外面那条狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, I gut old yeller out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.48,0:27:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么或许 你还有一线生机\N{\fnArial\fs30}and maybe… just maybe… you walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.41,0:27:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不这么做的话 你必死无疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't… you're meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.51,0:27:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, sit down, shut up…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.54,0:27:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴上手铐\N{\fnArial\fs30}and put these on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.62,0:28:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.29,0:28:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们到底是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you people?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.63,0:28:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是来帮忙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.86,0:28:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像你们帮玛姬一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you helped Margie?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.76,0:28:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱之犬靠近时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the hellhound gets close,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.72,0:28:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也许会幻视 幻听\N{\fnArial\fs30}you might start seeing things, hearing things.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.80,0:28:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像嗑药出现了不良反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna feel like you took the brown acid,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.45,0:28:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,折磨得你要死\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's trying to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.24,0:28:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,手铐是用来避免你们伤害自己的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The handcuffs are so you won't hurt yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.35,0:28:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你们有谁瞪圆了眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when one of you starts bugging out,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.58,0:28:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,就知道猎狗是冲着谁来的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll know who's on tap to be puppy chow.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.23,0:28:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…what's our play?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.59,0:28:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你待在这里 找出是谁出卖了自己的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you camp here, figure out who whored their soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.03,0:28:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去外面看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go scout the grounds …
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.99,0:28:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看能不能在它再次出击前杀了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}see if I can't gank huckleberry hound before he makes his next move.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.56,0:28:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你不能自己去 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, you're not going alone, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.43,0:28:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要跟你一起去 - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm gonna come with you. - Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.93,0:28:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正已经关着他们了 你需要人帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, they're on lockdown, and you need backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.33,0:28:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我才不用 - 你需要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, I don't. - Yes, you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.44,0:29:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你安安全全的 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I need you to be safe, Sam, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.13,0:29:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这才是我要的 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's what I need. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.03,0:29:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…我们什么时候真正安全过\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I…when are we ever safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.53,0:29:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.61,0:29:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.84,0:29:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为那三项测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of the three trials crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.55,0:29:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝的磨难考验\N{\fnArial\fs30}God's little obstacle course.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.15,0:29:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以前经历过这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been down roads like this before, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.91,0:29:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,黄眼恶魔 路西法 迪克·罗曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}With yellow-eyes, Lucifer, Dick friggin' Roman.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.79,0:29:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都知道结局怎样 我们其中一个要牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both know where this ends…one of us dies…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.02,0:29:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者更糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}or worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.51,0:29:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又怎样 你决定你该去牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what, you just up and decided it's gonna be you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.82,0:29:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个粗人 萨姆 你不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a grunt, Sam. You're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.76,0:29:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你总是出主意的人 - 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You've always been the brains of this operation. - Dean…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.15,0:29:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你说过 你看见了一条出路\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you told me yourself that you see a way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.72,0:29:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到这糟糕生活还有希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see a light at the end of this ugly-ass tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.14,0:29:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.83,0:29:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你我知道什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I tell you what I do know…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.98,0:29:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会战死\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's that I'm gonna die with a gun in my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.11,0:29:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为那就是等着我的结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause that's what I have waiting for me …
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.34,0:29:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我唯一的结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all I have waiting for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.94,0:29:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想让你走出这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.24,0:29:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想让你有一个生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to have a life…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.61,0:30:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为记录者 什么都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Become a man of letters, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.78,0:30:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,找个老婆 生几个孩子 还有孙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, with a wife and kids and…and…and grandkids,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.32,0:30:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,活到长胖 变秃 还有吃伟哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Living till you're fat and bald and chugging viagra…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.64,0:30:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那才是我理想中的结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is my perfect ending,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.42,0:30:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,也必须只有这一种结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's the only one that I'm gonna get.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.88,0:30:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我要去做这些测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm gonna do these trials.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.26,0:30:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要自己去做 就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna do them alone, end of story.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.97,0:30:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要待在这儿 我要出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're staying here. I'm going out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.65,0:30:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是那东西来了 你打电话给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}If landshark comes knocking, you call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.91,0:30:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是想跟着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you try to follow me,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.21,0:30:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就冲你的腿来一枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna put a bullet in your damn leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.05,0:31:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你出卖了你的灵魂 承认吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sold your soul, admit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.72,0:31:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会这样想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the hell would you think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.88,0:31:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你行将就木\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause you're a walking corpse,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.98,0:31:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,却娶了一个骚货\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're married to a centerfold.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.73,0:31:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不难想象\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did the math.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.45,0:31:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,她喜欢钱 我很有钱 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She likes money, and I'm rich. Do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.18,0:31:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你唱歌吓死人 怎么上的榜单\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sing like crap, so explain the music career.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.04,0:31:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道什么叫自动调音吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello … auto-tune!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.12,0:31:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.72,0:31:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 四眼怪 够了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, is it, four-eyes? Is it enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.11,0:31:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么会觉得我们有人做了恶魔交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know why you even think one of us made a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.44,0:31:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你们在没有石油的地方找到了石油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you struck oil where there was no any oil.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.92,0:31:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不觉得那很奇怪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That didn't seem weird to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.27,0:31:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Margie.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.52,0:31:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬以前常说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Margie used to say that…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.37,0:31:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们有钱 我们就会很幸福\N{\fnArial\fs30}that if we were rich, we'd all be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.89,0:31:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我们就是受诅咒的沃顿一家（70年代的一部剧集）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. We're the damn Waltons.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.46,0:32:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,来得正是时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.40,0:32:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉 你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellie, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.87,0:32:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.80,0:32:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢说你肯定很厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I bet you're great.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.96,0:32:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确 好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.67,0:32:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.73,0:32:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.84,0:32:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 无论发生什么 听到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, whatever happens, whatever you hear,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.32,0:32:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要待在这儿把门锁紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to stay in here with that door locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.83,0:32:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,别出去 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit tight, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.45,0:32:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这听起来会很疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is gonna sound crazy,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.51,0:32:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面有非常邪恶的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}but there is something evil out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.04,0:32:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.44,0:32:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.29,0:32:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是冲着我来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's coming for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.05,0:33:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要尿尿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to take a leak.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.14,0:33:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,憋着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.91,0:33:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这么大岁数能憋着吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, at my age?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.53,0:33:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really an option,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.97,0:33:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要么让我去 要么就给我个瓶子\N{\fnArial\fs30}so either you let me go or get me a bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.85,0:33:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,真恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.08,0:33:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.60,0:33:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.82,0:33:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.16,0:33:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我走吧 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let me go, please. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.28,0:33:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.15,0:33:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你不要伤害我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, don't hurt my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.06,0:33:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有 我是在帮你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not. I'm trying to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.15,0:34:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,快进屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.80,0:34:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 什么 - 快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? What? - Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.32,0:34:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天哪 - 快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, god! - Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.00,0:34:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父母离婚后 我妈来这儿工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}When my parents split up, my mom took a job here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.62,0:34:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是卡西迪家还没钱的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was before the Cassitys had money,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.46,0:34:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那是她能找到的最好的活儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it was the best she could do.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.06,0:34:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我在这个农场长大\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I grew up on this farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.68,0:34:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是这么遇见克劳力的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how you met Crowley?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.72,0:34:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们准备了一桌盛宴\N{\fnArial\fs30}They had this big dinner,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.56,0:34:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那之后 我看见他亲吻玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}and after, I saw him kissing Margie.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.34,0:34:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跑走了 不知道该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ran. I didn't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.32,0:34:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但克劳力找到了我 聊了聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Crowley found me. We talked.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.53,0:34:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他表现得很和善\N{\fnArial\fs30}He seemed so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.42,0:34:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,技艺高超的骗子都这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}The best con men always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.84,0:34:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他问我 我最大的愿望是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}He asked me, if I had one wish, what would it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.04,0:34:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就告诉了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I told him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.54,0:34:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他逼迫你卖了你的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he made you sign over your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.88,0:34:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没有逼迫我做任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't make me do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.61,0:34:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈妈 她患了帕金森\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom … she had Parkinson's …
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.92,0:34:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,早期阶段 我知道她结局是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}early stages, and I knew how that story would end.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.93,0:34:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我做了交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I took the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.91,0:35:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈现在退休了 每天在凤凰城打高尔夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma is retired down in Phoenix now, plays golf every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.47,0:35:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉 那真是太蠢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a stupid move, Ellie.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.21,0:35:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我是为了妈妈才这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did it for my mom, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.01,0:35:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,换做是你 你愿意为你妈妈做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would you do for your mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.55,0:35:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该知道会有这一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had to know this was coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.93,0:35:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 怎么可能知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. How?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.72,0:35:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力没有告诉你有十年期限\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley didn't tell you about the 10-year ticking clock?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.98,0:35:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.42,0:35:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知道我死后去不了天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew that when I died, I wasn't going to heaven,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.49,0:35:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他从没说过十年期限或者什么怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he never said anything about that or monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.98,0:35:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a douche bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.03,0:35:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概他也没跟卡尔和玛格特说\N{\fnArial\fs30}He probably didn't say jack to Carl or Margot, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.52,0:35:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬也做了交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Margie made a deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.16,0:35:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么她…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So she's…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.98,0:35:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,她死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.50,0:35:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.24,0:35:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.19,0:35:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,几年前 卡尔喝得烂醉\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few years ago, Carl got drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.09,0:35:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他告诉我他在一个十字路口施了魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told me he did some kind of magic at a crossroads …
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.71,0:35:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,召唤了一个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Summoned a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.61,0:35:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把事情一联系起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I put two and two together,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.84,0:35:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,又看到那东西对他做的事…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and when I saw what that thing did to him…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.63,0:35:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不知道玛姬也这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just never knew about Margie.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.23,0:35:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我才是下一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I was next.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.85,0:36:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 而你居然没逃走 - 逃去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And you didn't run? - Where would I run?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.53,0:36:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想吃好最后一顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I wanted was one last meal,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.63,0:36:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,再听听优美的旋律 也许\N{\fnArial\fs30}some good tunes, and maybe…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.11,0:36:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.75,0:36:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.00,0:36:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉 你看到的都不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellie, whatever you're seeing, it's not real.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.50,0:36:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这说明地狱之犬 就在附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means the hellhound … it's close.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.99,0:36:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好 你得待在这个圈里 明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you need to stay inside this circle, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.11,0:36:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,立刻进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.81,0:36:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.82,0:36:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论发生什么 你都不要出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter what happens, you stay inside that circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.67,0:36:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.07,0:37:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是克劳力的狗啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, so you're Crowley's bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.78,0:37:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,宠物还真像主人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess pets really do look like their owners.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.98,0:37:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在等什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.58,0:37:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come and get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.86,0:38:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得去医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to go to a hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.05,0:38:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不算严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I've had worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.27,0:38:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 这话不假\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he's had worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.66,0:38:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.32,0:38:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在要做个巫术袋 然后你就跑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we make a hex bag, and you start running.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.88,0:38:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果克劳力找不到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Crowley can't find you,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.86,0:39:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就不能再召唤别的狗杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}then he won't be able to sic another mutt on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.35,0:39:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我不用去地狱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm not going to hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.99,0:39:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,有我在就不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not on my watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.46,0:39:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能先出去一下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you give us a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.90,0:39:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.97,0:39:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.49,0:39:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 即使她能躲开克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, even if she can dodge Crowley,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.52,0:39:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要艾莉一死 她的灵魂就会进入地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}as soon as Ellie dies, her soul is earmarked for hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.85,0:39:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非我们把地狱关上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not if we shut it down first.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.80,0:39:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你念咒语肯定没用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The spell's not gonna work for you, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.64,0:39:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.76,0:39:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.10,0:39:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们再找一条地狱之犬 我来杀了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll track down another hellhound, and I'll kill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.18,0:39:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.76,0:39:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 我没能通过测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, I didn't pass the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.18,0:39:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我通过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I did…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.91,0:39:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩下的都让我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm doing the rest of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.20,0:39:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,想得美\N{\fnArial\fs30}My ass you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.06,0:39:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来关闭地狱之门\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm closing the gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.72,0:40:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你来说这无异于自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a suicide mission for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.08,0:40:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 萨姆 - 我也想关上地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam… - I want to slam hell shut, too, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.60,0:40:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我想活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I want to survive it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.23,0:40:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想活着 你也应该如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to live, and so should you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.60,0:40:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里有朋友 家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have friends up here, family.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.80,0:40:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼 你现在还有自己的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, hell, you even got your own room now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.34,0:40:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.59,0:40:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还看得到希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see light at the end of this tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.97,0:40:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的很抱歉你看不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm sorry you don't … I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.79,0:40:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但希望是有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.86,0:40:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你和我一起 我就能带你找到希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you come with me, I can take you to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.48,0:40:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 别傻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, be smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.54,0:40:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不傻 你也不傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am smart, and so are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.73,0:40:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你不是粗人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not a grunt, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.76,0:40:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个天才 在传说方面…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a genius … when it comes to lore, to …
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.15,0:40:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我见过的最棒的猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the best damn hunter I have ever seen …
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.10,0:40:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,比我好 比老爸好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better than me, better than dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.68,0:40:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe in you, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.44,0:40:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, please …
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.58,0:40:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托也请相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please believe in me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.53,0:41:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.80,0:41:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.64,0:41:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,小萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.31,0:41:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.19,0:41:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.75,0:41:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good. I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.76,0:41:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do this.
